'''''[[Strictly Come Dancing]]''''' returned for its twenty-third series with a launch show on 20 September 2025 on [[BBC One]], with live shows beginning from 27 September.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.manchestereveningnews.co.uk/news/tv/bbc-strictly-come-dancings-huge-32303246 |title=BBC Strictly Come Dancing's huge update on applying for tickets to live shows with strict rules |first=Jessica |last=Sansome |date=2025-08-19 |access-date=2025-08-19 |website=[[Manchester Evening News]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Strictly Come Dancing {{!}} Shows and tours |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/showsandtours/shows/strictly-come-dancing-2025 |date=2025-08-19 |access-date=2025-08-19 |website=BBC}}</ref> [[Tess Daly]] and [[Claudia Winkleman]] returned as hosts, whilst [[Janette Manrara]] and [[Fleur East]] returned to host ''[[Strictly Come Dancing: It Takes Two]]''.<ref>{{cite web |last=Sarrubba |first=Stefania |date=26 June 2025 |title=''Strictly'' kicks off 2025 series with line-up confirmation - is your favourite star returning? |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/a65208644/strictly-2025-series-line-up-confirmation/ |access-date=14 July 2025 |website=[[Digital Spy]]}}</ref> [[Craig Revel Horwood]], [[Motsi Mabuse]], [[Shirley Ballas]] and [[Anton Du Beke]] returned to the judging panel.<ref>{{cite web |last=Ross |first=Alex |date=27 June 2025 |title=''Strictly Come Dancing'' confirm hosts and judges for 2025 series |url=https://hellorayo.co.uk/tay/entertainment/television/strictly-come-dancing-guide |access-date=14 July 2025 |website=[[Tay FM]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Griffiths |first=Emmy |date=27 June 2025 |title=''Strictly Come Dancing'' confirms hosts and judges for 2025 - but viewers demand major change |url=https://www.hellomagazine.com/film/840760/strictly-come-dancing-confirms-hosts-and-judges-for-2025/?viewas=amp |access-date=14 July 2025 |website=[[Hello! (magazine)|Hello!]] |language=en}}</ref> It was the last series to be presented by Daly and Winkleman, who announced their departures on 23 October 2025.<ref>{{cite web |last=Saunders |first=Emma |editor-last=Moon |editor-first=Jenna |title='It's been an absolute dream': Tess Daly and Claudia Winkleman to leave Strictly |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/live/c77d3p6r2r8t |language=en-gb |publisher=[[BBC]] |date=23 October 2025 |access-date=23 October 2025 }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Hibbs |first=James |title=BBC reacts to Strictly Come Dancing presenting bombshell as Tess and Claudia's final appearance dates confirmed |url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/entertainment/strictly-tess-claudia-bbc-reaction-newsupdate |language=en-gb |website=[[Radio Times]] |date=23 October 2025 |access-date=23 October 2025 }}</ref>

The series concluded on 20 December 2025, when footballer [[Karen Carney]] and her partner [[Carlos Gu]] were announced as the winners, with [[Amber Davies]] and [[Nikita Kuzmin]], and [[George Clarke (internet personality)|George Clarke]] and [[Alexis Warr]] finishing as the runners-up.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/tv/2025/12/20/strictly-come-dancing-2025-final/#1766265103400 |title=Karen Carney crowned Strictly champion|work=[[The Daily Telegraph]]|first=Chris|last=Bennion|date=20 December 2025|accessdate=20 December 2025}}</ref>

